OL,3,GNEWSAThree released on bail after sword
OL,4,Aattack
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men and a teenage boy who were
OL,7,Farrested after a teenager was injured
OL,8,Fin an attack involving a sword near two
OL,9,Fschools have been released on bail,
OL,10,Fpolice said.
OL,12,FSt Peter's High School and Willow
OL,13,FPrimary Academy in Gloucester were put
OL,14,Finto lockdown after the incident at
OL,15,F08:50 GMT on Friday. Gloucestershire
OL,16,FPolice said a 17-year-old suffered a
OL,17,Fsuperficial wound believed to have been
OL,18,Fcaused by the sword.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
