OL,3,GNEWSAThree released on bail after sword
OL,4,Aattack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 19-year-old man was arrested on
OL,7,FFriday night on suspicion of assault
OL,8,Foccasioning actual bodily harm and
OL,9,Faffray and a 17-year-old boy was
OL,10,Farrested on suspicion of assisting an
OL,11,Foffender.
OL,13,FThey have both been released on bail
OL,14,Fpending further investigation, police
OL,15,Fhave said.
